cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - name: RakTikoo
title: "labunits: batch-convert lab-result CSV columns between conventional and SI units, with twice-verified factors"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-17
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/labunits"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/labunits"
abstract: >-
  Batch-converts whole columns of a lab-results CSV between
  conventional (US) and SI units for 60 analytes, each factor verified
  against two independent authorities and written next to every
  converted column; analytes with no single verified factor are
  refused with the reason. Research and educational tool only; not a
  medical device. Conversion only: no reference ranges, no flagging,
  no interpretation.
keywords:
  - unit conversion
  - SI units
  - laboratory results
  - clinical chemistry
